---

<section id="systemes" class="hrn-systems">
  <div class="hrn-section-inner">
    <div class="hrn-systems__head">
      <div>
        <div class="hrn-eyebrow">Nos systèmes</div>
        <h2>Voici ce que nous installons pour régler ça</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/blog" class="hrn-systems__all">
        Voir tous les systèmes
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="hrn-systems__grid">
      <a href="/blog/comptes-rendus" class="hrn-systems__card">
        <div class="hrn-systems__thumb hrn-systems__thumb--icon">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><path d="M14 3v5h5"></path><path d="M9 13h6"></path><path d="M9 17h4"></path></svg>
          <span>Installé chez un client des Herbiers</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hrn-systems__body">
          <h3>Comptes rendus automatiques</h3>
          <p>De l'audio de réunion au compte rendu envoyé, sans une minute de saisie.</p>
          <span class="hrn-systems__cta">Voir le système<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/blog/facebook-crm" class="hrn-systems__card">
        <div class="hrn-systems__thumb hrn-systems__thumb--icon">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"></rect><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"></rect><path d="M10 6.5h5.5a2 2 0 0 1 2 2V13"></path><path d="m15.5 11 2 2 2-2"></path><path d="M14 17.5H8.5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V11"></path><path d="m4.5 13 2-2 2 2"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="hrn-systems__body">
          <h3>Connexion de vos outils</h3>
          <p>Un lead arrive, il part dans le tableur, dans le CRM et alerte l'équipe. Sans copier-coller.</p>
          <span class="hrn-systems__cta">Voir le système<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/blog/devis-excel" class="hrn-systems__card">
        <div class="hrn-systems__thumb hrn-systems__thumb--icon">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 3h12v18l-3-2-3 2-3-2-3 2z"></path><path d="M9.5 8h5"></path><path d="M9.5 12h5"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="hrn-systems__body">
          <h3>Devis et relances automatisés</h3>
          <p>Le devis part, la relance se déclenche seule au bon moment, vous suivez tout depuis un tableau unique.</p>
          <span class="hrn-systems__cta">Voir le système<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hrn-systems {
    padding: clamp(56px, 8vw, 96px) 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    scroll-margin-top: 68px;
  }

  .hrn-systems__head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .hrn-systems__all {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--slate-600);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .hrn-systems__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  .hrn-systems__card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: box-shadow var(--dur) var(--ease-standard), transform var(--dur) var(--ease-standard), border-color var(--dur);
  }

  .hrn-systems__card:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
  }

  .hrn-systems__thumb {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }

  .hrn-systems__thumb--icon {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, var(--surface-2), var(--surface-2) 12px, var(--surface-3) 12px, var(--surface-3) 24px);
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .hrn-systems__thumb--icon span {
    max-width: 26ch;
    padding: 0 16px;
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hrn-systems__body {
    padding: 22px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .hrn-systems__body h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--text-strong);
  }

  .hrn-systems__body p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .hrn-systems__cta {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 12px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--slate-600);
  }
</style>
